{"articleNo":"84721","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=84721&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2013학년도 2학기 국가장학금 신청안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2013.06.10","hit":"6317","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">1.</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">신청대상자 :</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"> 2013-2학기 등록금 납부 대상자, 2013-2학기 복학예정자</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (휴학예정자도 등록금을 미리 납부할 경우 지원받을 수 있음)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#0900ff\"><strong>2. 서류제출 : 2013.7.10(수) 18시까지</strong></font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;<u>※ 서류제출방법</u></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 홈페이지 업로드 : 사이버창구-장학대출신청-신청현황 왼쪽하단 '</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">서류제출' 버튼을 눌러</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 스캔 및 사진파일 업로드</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; - 모바일 업로드 : 한국장학재단 학자금 서류제출 앱다운-로그인-'파일찾기' 버튼을 눌러</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 사진파일 업로드</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; - 팩스제출 : 02-3419-8800</span></